---
Show this message, or the help of one command.

Usage: ink help [TOPIC]...

Examples
  ink help exit        # The exit codes
  ink help page.title  # What a decision or diagnostic code means

Arguments
  [TOPIC]...  A command (`deploy rollback`), `exit`, `environment`, or a
              diagnostic or decision code

Exit codes
  0  Done; warnings, if any, were printed
  1  The site has errors
  2  Wrong usage, or a folder that is missing; nothing was changed

Docs    https://github.com/uses-ink/uses.ink/blob/main/docs/cli.md
Global  -C, --json, -q, -v, --color, --no-progress, --log, --log-file
        (see `ink --help`)
